<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Based on the Company&rsquo;s
current cash position, including the bridge financing round expected to raise aggregate proceeds of $5 million, the Company has a cash
runway towards the end of March&nbsp;2024. Further funding is required and will be pursued through the Company&acute;s long-term funding
strategy. Please refer to form 20-F, filed April&nbsp;28, for additional background on the Company.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

